WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.111 --> 00:00:01.692
- You know you have this dream,

00:00:01.692 --> 00:00:03.926
and sometimes you need to
let loose of that dream

00:00:03.926 --> 00:00:05.513
because it's not going to work out,

00:00:05.513 --> 00:00:07.264
but I always give the
advice that, you know,

00:00:07.264 --> 00:00:09.620
you should really try to stick it out

00:00:09.620 --> 00:00:11.371
as long as possible because some things,

00:00:11.371 --> 00:00:13.162
good things tend to take a long time.

00:00:13.162 --> 00:00:15.158
(inspiring music)

00:00:15.158 --> 00:00:16.294
My name is Philipp Man,

00:00:16.294 --> 00:00:18.252
I am one of the founders of Chronext,

00:00:18.252 --> 00:00:20.577
the full service platform
for luxury watches.

00:00:20.577 --> 00:00:24.002
Chronext is a online
marketplace for luxury watches,

00:00:24.002 --> 00:00:26.679
so we have over 600 retailers worldwide

00:00:26.679 --> 00:00:28.700
who buy sell and service
their watches for us,

00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:30.982
and we take of their
shipment, the logistics,

00:00:30.982 --> 00:00:33.843
the authentication,
payment, the whole presale

00:00:33.843 --> 00:00:35.225
and after sale service.

00:00:35.225 --> 00:00:36.372
So when you buy from us,

00:00:36.372 --> 00:00:38.240
it feels like buying
at a boutique offline,

00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:41.089
but you have all the benefits
of an online marketplace.

00:00:41.089 --> 00:00:42.233
My co-founder and I,

00:00:42.233 --> 00:00:44.111
we both started the
business in our kitchen

00:00:44.111 --> 00:00:45.741
in London, Maida Vale,

00:00:45.741 --> 00:00:48.594
and we were both watch geeks, essentially,

00:00:48.594 --> 00:00:50.225
and we understood that there's actually,

00:00:50.225 --> 00:00:52.504
there's no platform for
buying luxury watches online

00:00:52.504 --> 00:00:54.455
or selling them in a safe way.

00:00:54.455 --> 00:00:55.798
We thought, okay, luxury watches,

00:00:55.798 --> 00:00:58.115
it's a passion product,
it's not a big market,

00:00:58.115 --> 00:00:59.539
but we realized, actually, you know,

00:00:59.539 --> 00:01:01.855
it's a 90,000,000,000 annual industry,

00:01:01.855 --> 00:01:03.240
and there's no one doing it,

00:01:03.240 --> 00:01:04.502
so let's just try it.

00:01:04.502 --> 00:01:07.064
So we bootstrapped the business
for one and a half years,

00:01:07.064 --> 00:01:09.264
and the turning point
really came after we raised

00:01:09.264 --> 00:01:11.463
out first round of
financing because it allowed

00:01:11.463 --> 00:01:13.778
us to invest into, really, marketing

00:01:13.778 --> 00:01:16.582
and kind of the technology
behind it to get to know

00:01:16.582 --> 00:01:18.938
the customer and give a better experience

00:01:18.938 --> 00:01:20.076
to the customer,

00:01:20.076 --> 00:01:21.376
and after three and a half years now,

00:01:21.376 --> 00:01:22.757
we are probably one of
the largest resellers

00:01:22.757 --> 00:01:25.841
in the world for luxury watches.

00:01:25.841 --> 00:01:28.158
I think the motivation
for me personally is,

00:01:28.158 --> 00:01:30.112
you are confronted with issues,

00:01:30.112 --> 00:01:31.619
you have no idea how to solve them,

00:01:31.619 --> 00:01:33.854
it's a completely new
kind of playing field,

00:01:33.854 --> 00:01:35.320
you've never done this before.

00:01:35.320 --> 00:01:36.419
And you work at it,

00:01:36.419 --> 00:01:38.731
and you keep trying and
trying and trying and trying,

00:01:38.731 --> 00:01:40.316
and you still haven't found a solution,

00:01:40.316 --> 00:01:41.781
and then suddenly there's just a spark,

00:01:41.781 --> 00:01:44.425
and you know, it solves a
complex problem for you.

00:01:44.425 --> 00:01:47.226
And, the gratification of
being able to solve something

00:01:47.226 --> 00:01:49.340
that a hundred other people in the company

00:01:49.340 --> 00:01:50.567
may not have been doing, or,

00:01:50.567 --> 00:01:52.277
they've been waiting for you to do it,

00:01:52.277 --> 00:01:55.243
is, is quite big, because
it shows that, you know,

00:01:55.243 --> 00:01:57.117
when you really dedicate all your focus

00:01:57.117 --> 00:01:58.580
and your time to something,

00:01:58.580 --> 00:02:00.330
it can pay off a lot.

00:02:02.524 --> 00:02:04.315
Luxury watches may seem very trivial,

00:02:04.315 --> 00:02:06.427
but actually it's something
what people save for,

00:02:06.427 --> 00:02:08.141
a long time, to really buy this item.

00:02:08.141 --> 00:02:10.132
It's not something that
you just buy like this,

00:02:10.132 --> 00:02:12.326
you know, it's something
to mark an anniversary,

00:02:12.326 --> 00:02:13.950
to mark a big success in your life,

00:02:13.950 --> 00:02:15.823
so people really take
a lot of time to think

00:02:15.823 --> 00:02:16.954
what they're going to buy,

00:02:16.954 --> 00:02:18.457
where they're going to buy it.

00:02:18.457 --> 00:02:21.394
So every time a customer
buys from us is a success.

00:02:21.394 --> 00:02:24.227
(inspiring music)

